      "block_id": "2605.22715_p24_b0",
      "text": "such as MantisV2 and COMODO with a MantisV2 IMU backbone, IMU segments are resized to\nthe model input length by interpolation. We report Acc@1, Acc@5, and macro-F1 to measure exact\nrecognition, near-miss retrieval among many candidate activities, and class-balanced performance.\n",
