      "block_id": "2605.22715_p24_b1",
      "text": "Results and implications. As shown in Table 8, the results indicate that AnyMo Bench is challenging.\nOn Fine150 / Unseen Subject, MantisV2 and COMODO reach comparable top-line accuracy, with\nMantisV2 at 38.5% Acc@1 and 65.2% Acc@5 and COMODO at 37.8% Acc@1 and 65.2% Acc@5,\nwhile DeepConvLSTM reaches 35.3% Acc@1 and 63.0% Acc@5. These results are meaningful for\na 150-class in-the-wild unseen-subject task, but the macro-F1 scores indicate substantial remaining\ndifficulty on tail and fine-grained classes. Core50 improves recognition accuracy, with COMODO\nreaching 46.2% Acc@1 and 78.8% Acc@5, while MantisV2 obtains the strongest macro-F1 at 41.3%;\nhowever, the remaining error shows that reducing the label granularity does not make the task trivial.\nCross-device evaluation remains much harder: COMODO gives the strongest cross-device Acc@1,\nreaching 24.0% on Fine150 and 32.6% on Core50, but the gap from same-device unseen-subject\nrecognition remains large, revealing substantial room for same-position different-device transfer.\n",
      "bbox": [
        107.64,
        112.6,
        505.74,
        231.67
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        430,
        450,
        2022,
        926
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.86,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 1036,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.22715_p24_b2",
      "text": "These results suggest that the difficulty comes not only from label granularity, but also from realistic\nsubject and device shifts. Because the benchmark construction combines automatic label proposal,\nembedding-based semantic label consolidation, human-expert review, enum-label assignment, full\nclass-wise auditing, relabel/drop decisions, and IMU-pose-aware label-space aggregation, AnyMo\nBench provides a challenging, in-the-wild, and carefully curated testbed for future work on robust\nwearable motion recognition.\n",
      "bbox": [
        107.64,
        238.14,
        505.25,
